WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:04.720
Have you ever wondered what&nbsp;
SCP-2006, Too Spooky, secretly wants?

00:00:04.720 --> 00:00:09.440
Foundation staff took a photo&nbsp;
of SCP-2006 using SCP-978,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:09.440 --> 00:00:14.320
the Desire Camera, while it was standing in&nbsp;
its containment cell. This was the result:

00:00:14.320 --> 00:00:22.080
"Close-up of SCP-2006's face, "screaming" at&nbsp;
the camera. SCP-2006 is in its Ro-Man form."

00:00:22.080 --> 00:00:25.680
This particular experiment didn't&nbsp;
really provide any new information.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:32.080
SCP-2006 is a simple creature with a&nbsp;
simple goal: it just wants to scare people.

